<article class="env-lemma" id="039S">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/039S">Lemma <span data-tag="039S">41.19.1</span>.</a> Let $A$, $B$ be Noetherian local rings. Let $A \to B$ be a étale homomorphism of local rings. Then $\dim (A) = \dim (B)$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
